-- The scaled Hecke operator at a marked prime has image of small index on
-- the integral columns.
-- Source: grh-compact/src/New/Columns/MarkedPrimeType.lean ("This file:
-- Scaled Hecke operator at a marked prime has image of small index on
-- columns."; Data.IsMarked.hasType_markOperator).
